Spawn the project-dreamer subagent (subagent_type project-dreamer; if unavailable, general-purpose with $HOME/.claude/agents/project-dreamer.md as the brief). It executes the full project dream loop per its brief: pick tonight's project (most real recent activity), ground in session history + knowledge/projects memory + repo docs + git history, mine architecture debt (pragmatic) and dream features/better architecture (vision), synthesize via the gossip bus, write the dream report to knowledge/dreams/project/$(date +%F)-<project-slug>.md, respect trust ladder + dreams/config.json (never_auto is constitutional; project repos are NEVER edited — advisory-only is constitutional). FILE-GATE: every proposal in the report must have a matching knowledge/dreams/proposals/$(date +%F)-<slug>.md file (cap 3/night) — an unfiled idea is an incomplete run. When done, heartbeat check-in: echo '{"ts":"<now UTC ISO>","job":"project-dreamer"}' | python3 ~/.claude/knowledge/scripts/atomic_io.py ~/.claude/knowledge/garden-reports/heartbeat.jsonl (atomic writer; NEVER a plain >> append — plain appends get wiped by concurrent atomic replaces), then relay only the report path + verdict + proposals filed count.
